---
layout: base.njk
title: Available
nav: available
summary: Original paintings by Cole Calfee, available now.
ogSource: red-sea.jpg
permalink: /available/
pieces:
  - handle: red-sea
    title: Red Sea
    medium: Oil on canvas
    size: 36 × 48 in.
    src: red-sea.jpg
    alt: Red Sea, a large red painting in oil on canvas, leaning on paint buckets in the studio
  - handle: flowers-in-mccarty-vase
    title: Flowers in McCarty Vase
    medium: Oil on canvas
    size: 24 × 30 in.
    src: flowers-in-mccarty-vase.jpg
    alt: Flowers in McCarty Vase, white and yellow flowers in a vase on a red ground, oil on canvas
---
<main id="main" class="wrap">
<div class="grid page-head">
<h1>Available</h1>
<p class="count cap">{{ pieces.length | pad | replace("0", "", 1) }} Original works</p>
</div>
<div class="grid avail">
<p class="note">Original paintings, one of each. Purchase opens a secure Shopify checkout. To ask about a work, use Inquire.</p>
<div class="grid-2">
{%- for p in pieces %}
<figure class="fig piece" data-handle="{{ p.handle }}">
{% picture p.src, p.alt, "(min-width: 1024px) 31vw, (min-width: 700px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 32px)", loop.first %}
<figcaption>
<span>{{ p.title }}</span>
<span class="cap">{{ p.medium }} / {{ p.size }}</span>
<span class="sale cap"><span class="price" hidden></span><button type="button" class="act cap" data-buy hidden>Purchase</button><!--email_off--><a class="act cap" data-inquire href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ p.title | urlencode }}">Inquire</a><!--/email_off--></span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</main>
<script type="module" src="/js/available.js"></script>
